msgid "Off"
msgstr "关"

#: main.ts:250
msgid "Shader upscaling was turned off because the player did not close normally while it was on. Turn it on again, or first choose a preset that is not marked demanding."
msgstr "着色器超分辨率已关闭，因为它开启时播放器未正常退出。可以重新开启，或先选择一个未标为“高负载”的预设。"

#. {} is the preset, for example "Anime4K mode A (Fast)".
#: main.ts:259
msgid "On: {}"
msgstr "开：{}"

#: main.ts:268
msgid "On, but a shader did not compile"
msgstr "开，但有着色器编译失败"

#. {} is mpv's compiler message, in English.
#: main.ts:272
msgid "The player cannot tell whose shader failed when other plugins add shaders too. Its message: {}"
msgstr "其他插件也添加了着色器时，播放器无法判断是谁的着色器失败。播放器的消息：{}"

#: main.ts:278 main.ts:287
msgid "On, but not applied"
msgstr "开，但未生效"

#. {} is the player's own message, in English.
#: main.ts:282
msgid "Other plugins' shaders leave no room: at most 16 shaders run at once. {}"
msgstr "其他插件的着色器已占满：同时最多运行 16 个着色器。{}"

#: main.ts:293
msgid "On: applying…"
msgstr "开：正在应用…"

#: main.ts:295
msgid "On: applies when a video plays"
msgstr "开：播放视频时生效"

#: main.ts:304
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "模式"

#. {} is the mode (A+A, B+B or C+A).
#: main.ts:309
msgid "Mode {} (demanding)"
msgstr "模式 {}（高负载）"

#: main.ts:312
msgid "Mode {}"
msgstr "模式 {}"

#: main.ts:315
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "画质"

#: main.ts:317
msgid "HQ (demanding): large networks, fast GPU"
msgstr "高画质（高负载）：大网络，需要较快的 GPU"

#: main.ts:317
msgid "Fast: smaller networks, most GPUs"
msgstr "快速：小网络，适合大多数 GPU"

#: main.ts:322
msgid "Size"
msgstr "规模"

#: main.ts:324
msgid "C4F32 (demanding): more detail, needs a faster GPU"
msgstr "C4F32（高负载）：细节更多，需要较快的 GPU"

#: main.ts:324
msgid "C4F16: light on the GPU"
msgstr "C4F16：GPU 负担小"

#: main.ts:327
msgid "Variant"
msgstr "变体"

#: main.ts:339
msgid "Mode A: for most 1080p anime and blurry older or SD anime. Restores lines and removes blur, noise and compression smear; can strengthen ringing or banding already in the video."
msgstr "模式 A：适合大多数 1080p 动画，以及模糊的老动画或标清动画。修复线条，去除模糊、噪点和压缩涂抹；视频中已有的振铃或色带可能被加强。"

#: main.ts:342
msgid "Mode B: for most 720p anime and anime downscaled from 1080p. A softer restore that also reduces ringing and aliasing; some blur may stay."
msgstr "模式 B：适合大多数 720p 动画和由 1080p 缩小的动画。修复较柔和，同时减少振铃和锯齿；可能残留一些模糊。"

#: main.ts:345
msgid "Mode C: for clean sources with little blur, such as anime downscaled to 480p. Upscales with denoising and stays closest to the source."
msgstr "模式 C：适合模糊很少的干净片源，例如缩小到 480p 的动画。放大时降噪，最接近原片。"

#: main.ts:348
msgid "Mode A+A (demanding): mode A with a second restore pass: the sharpest lines, but it can ring, band or alias. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 A+A（高负载）：模式 A 再加一遍修复：线条最锐利，但可能出现振铃、色带或锯齿。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:350
msgid "Mode B+B (demanding): mode B with a second soft restore pass. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 B+B（高负载）：模式 B 再加一遍柔和修复。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:351
msgid "Mode C+A (demanding): mode C with a restore pass after it. Only when the video is enlarged 2× or more."
msgstr "模式 C+A（高负载）：模式 C 之后再加一遍修复。仅在视频放大 2 倍或以上时使用。"

#: main.ts:355
msgid "HQ (demanding) runs the large networks (VL and M): about four times the work of Fast; for fast GPUs."
msgstr "高画质（高负载）运行大网络（VL 和 M）：计算量约为快速的四倍，适合较快的 GPU。"

#: main.ts:356
msgid "Fast runs the smaller networks (M and S), for most GPUs."
msgstr "快速运行较小的网络（M 和 S），适合大多数 GPU。"

#: main.ts:358
msgid "Anime4K: neural networks for anime and cartoons that restore and double the picture twice."
msgstr "Anime4K：面向动画和卡通的神经网络，修复画面并两次放大一倍。"

#: main.ts:363
msgid "Neutral: doubles the detail without changing the picture's character."
msgstr "中性：细节放大一倍，不改变画面风格。"

#: main.ts:364
msgid "Denoise and sharpen: also removes noise and sharpens lines."
msgstr "降噪并锐化：同时去除噪点并锐化线条。"

#: main.ts:365
msgid "Denoise and soften: removes noise, with a softer result."
msgstr "降噪并柔化：去除噪点，效果较柔和。"

#: main.ts:370
msgid "ArtCNN: a small neural network trained on anime that doubles the brightness (luma) detail once; the player scales the colour."
msgstr "ArtCNN：以动画训练的小型神经网络，将亮度（luma）细节放大一倍；色彩由播放器缩放。"

#: main.ts:374
msgid "C4F32 (demanding) runs a network four times the size of C4F16; for fast GPUs."
msgstr "C4F32（高负载）运行的网络是 C4F16 的四倍大，适合较快的 GPU。"

