msgid "Shader Upscaling turned off: the player did not close normally"
msgstr "着色器超分辨率已关闭：播放器上次未正常退出"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Shader Upscale for Vestra Player"
msgstr "Vestra Player 着色器超分辨率"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Real-time AI upscaling of the video with mpv GLSL shaders: Anime4K and ArtCNN"
msgstr "用 mpv GLSL 着色器实时 AI 超分辨率：Anime4K 和 ArtCNN"

#: manifest.json
msgid "Sharpens and enlarges the video on the GPU while it plays, with neural-network shaders for mpv bundled in the plugin: Anime4K (six modes, Fast or HQ) and ArtCNN (two sizes, neutral, denoise and sharpen, or denoise and soften). Video ▸ Shader Upscaling… opens a window to choose the model and its parameters, turn upscaling on and off, and see what is applied. Needs GPU rendering: macOS, or Windows with Video ▸ GPU Rendering (Experimental); ArtCNN needs Windows. Remembers your choice."
msgstr "播放时在 GPU 上锐化并放大视频，使用插件自带的 mpv 神经网络着色器：Anime4K（六种模式，快速或高画质）和 ArtCNN（两种规模，中性、降噪并锐化或降噪并柔化）。“视频 ▸ 着色器超分辨率…”打开一个窗口，可选择模型及其参数、开关超分辨率，并查看当前应用的内容。需要 GPU 渲染：macOS，或在 Windows 上打开“视频 ▸ GPU 渲染（实验性）”；ArtCNN 需要 Windows。会记住你的选择。"

